OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStaying mostly cloudy with
OL,6,Ffrequent showers forming longer spells
OL,7,Fof rain at times, but a few bright or
OL,8,Fsunny intervals also expected. Fresh
OL,9,Fnortherly winds, feeling cool.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FScattered slight showers and
OL,12,Fclear spells through the evening.
OL,13,FShowers mostly fade out overnight but
OL,14,Fremaining rather cloudy and breezy.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FIt will be cool and cloudy
OL,17,Fthroughout the day but staying dry.
OL,18,FNorth to northwest winds easing a
OL,19,Flittle.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
