OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FSaturday and Sunday will see a few
OL,7,Fsunny intervals along with some
OL,8,Fshowers. Dry with bright or sunny
OL,9,Fspells on Monday.
